      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Um, excuse me, mister",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But can you please turn down the lights?",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I don't really like all these cameras, man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And this shit just don't feel right (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And I don't really wanna be rude to you, sir",
          "rhyme": "iR",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But fuck you mean I can't wear my hat in here?",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And you got me fucked up, if you think I care, nigga (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I hope you little niggas is listening",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Them Golf Boys is in this bitch like an infant",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "The blind niggas used to make fun of my vision",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And now I pay a mortgage and they stuck with tuition (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "So special, the teacher asked if I was autistic",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "And now I'm making plates, you just washing the dishes",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "So if you don't mind, get the fuck out of my kitchen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "But keep your ego there so I can butt fuck your opinion (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "But in the meantime, brainwashing millions of minions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Leader of the new school? (Ha, I'm in my own school)",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "And you would never catch me in none of their fucking shin-digs",
          "rhyme": "ig",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "I hope you fucking niggas is angry, pissed, and offended",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "\"In Search Of...\" did more for me than \"Illmatic\"",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "That's when I realized we ain't cut from the same fabric",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "I made my own shit, you went out and bought yours",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Man, I got too much drive, motherfucker, I hate traffic (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "La-di-da-di, I'm going harder",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Than coming out the closet to conservative Christian fathers",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "When it's a lot at stake carne asada but let's be honest, I'm really morphing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Named my album \"Cherry Bomb\" because \"Greatest Hits\" sounded boring",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "I don't like to follow the rules",
          "rhyme": "yl",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "She said that I must, I don't have any armpits",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "She wanted to talk; \"Who's in charge of this Golf shit?\"",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "I said \"Howdy do? How are you? I'm the sergeant (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "And who I are isn't really impartant",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "My heart is as dark as a window with car tint",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "So hop in with your friends, gal and I'll unpark it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "And I'll do donuts until the fat one is carsick\"",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "It's young T",
          "rhyme": "t",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        }
      ],
